00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.800
What events do you think were the biggest game&nbsp;
changers for Eastern Europe throughout history?

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.760
I have to say the migration period during the&nbsp;
early middle ages, although, I am quite biased&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:08.560
in this, you’ll find out why later. So basically&nbsp;
it was from the migration period that the current&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.760
cultural an ethnic makeup of not just Eastern&nbsp;
Europe but Europe in general stems from,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:19.440
and it is this ethnic makeup that fueled much of&nbsp;
the nation-centric history of modern Europe and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.760
still affects our politics to this day. Well,&nbsp;
there are actually a lot of caveats to that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:29.040
